   "titulo": "Numbers and price questions",
   "texto": [
    "To ask how much it costs «Hoeveel kost dit?» (in singular) or «Hoeveel kosten deze?» (in plural with «kosten»). The numbers of the tens are regular: twenty (20), dertig (30), veertig (40), vijftig (50) and Hondd (100). See that the «euro» coin is kept in singular after the numerals: «twaalf euro», «twintig euro»."
   ]
